{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c569","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a9c5-2eb3-7902-83b0-77aeb115d140"},"sequence":271,"recorded_at":1780531400000537,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0bd83bfa-ae0a-4313-a4d0-115d5a67d246","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"0bd83bfa-ae0a-4313-a4d0-115d5a67d246","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0bd83bfa-ae0a-4313-a4d0-115d5a67d246"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a9c5-ec7d-7953-a360-a6572ccd7ade"},"task_id":"01a0a9c5-ec7d-7953-a360-a6572ccd7ade","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a9c5-ec7d-7953-a360-a6572ccd7ade","chunk":"Read text file `/tmp/r4/logbook-rev3.md`.\n1|# TASK-260916-304bw2 — reviewer logbook, revision 3\n2|\n3|Exact candidate debeb04099cfb7e7cd7374ed1e993d092c943bf3. Six prior focused regressions pass. Three new production-entry probes fail with five assertions. Same-account re-login through real GitHubAuth.Flow defeats account-based continuity: old Apply resumes authenticated work/publication and old unregister executes removal. Relink rewrites the catalog scope, allowing an old editor to PUT to another organization. These repeat R2-F1/F2/F3, so retain named regressions plus narrowing mutants in the owning leaf. Coherent session incarnation must distinguish login replacement from token refresh; original editor identity must survive mutable catalog/disk changes. No production mutations or product-code edits. Verdict changes_requested; no human blocker.","final_result":true}}}
