access before applying.\"\n1076|            await action { Runners.Action.groupAccessInvalidated(id, message) }\n1077|            return nil\n1078|        }\n1079|        let components = url.pathComponents.filter { $0 != \"/\" }\n1080|        let diskHost = url.host ?? \"\"\n1081|        let matches = components.count == 1\n1082|            && components[0] == stored.org\n1083|            && RunnerRegistration.OperationIdentity.normalizeServerHost(diskHost)\n1084|                == RunnerRegistration.OperationIdentity.normalizeServerHost(stored.serverHost)\n1085|            && agentID == stored.agentID\n1086|            && agentName == stored.agentName\n1087|            && canonical == stored.canonicalPath\n1088|            && entry.localID == stored.localID\n1089|        guard matches else {\n1090|            editorAuthorities.removeValue(forKey: entry.serviceLabel)\n1091|            let foundScope = components.count == 1 ? components[0] : (components.joined(separator: \"/\").isEmpty ? \"?\" : components.joined(separator: \"/\"))\n1092|            let message = \"Runner identity changed since loading (expected \\(stored.serverHost)/\\(stored.org)/agent\\(stored.agentID), found \\(diskHost)/\\(foundScope)/agent\\(agentID)). Reload group access before applying.\"\n1093|            await action { Runners.Action.groupAccessInvalidated(id, message) }\n1094|            return nil\n1095|        }\n1096|        return VerifiedOrgRunner(entry: entry, directory: directory, org: stored.org, agentID: stored.agentID, agentName: stored.agentName)\n1097|    }\n1098|\n1099|    /// Applies edited repository access to the runner's fresh group. Rejects\n1100|    /// stale UI (group moved since load), shared groups without explicit\n1101|    /// takeover, and partial confirmations. When a Load established an\n1102|    /// immutable editor authority, Apply consumes that tuple and refuses when\n1103|    /// the current identity no longer matches it — never reconstructing\n1104|    /// 