{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000df59","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a9c5-2eb3-7902-83b0-77aeb115d140"},"sequence":3591,"recorded_at":1780531400007177,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0bd83bfa-ae0a-4313-a4d0-115d5a67d246","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"0bd83bfa-ae0a-4313-a4d0-115d5a67d246","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0bd83bfa-ae0a-4313-a4d0-115d5a67d246"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Revision 4 is ready for review (handed off to review, board `to-review`).\n\nImplemented immutable login incarnation (`GitHubSessionIdentity.sessionIncarnation`, fresh UUID per Device Flow login, shared via `RunnerRuntime` composition, `sessionStill` now requires incarnation) and immutable Load-time editor authority (`Runners.EditorAuthority` + `editorInvalidated`, `Apply` consumes the stored tuple, `relink` requires full server/scope/agent identity and invalidates). Adopted all three exact rev3 probes plus 5 bounds (sibling Load relogin, refresh positive, unregister retry, two relink reload recoveries).\n\nChanged: `GitHubSessionIdentityStore`, `GitHubAuth+Flow`, `RunnerRuntime`, `Runners+Flow`, `Runners+Models`, `Runners+State`, `Runners+State+Reducer`, plus `GitHubAuthFlowTests` and `RunnerCatalogLifecycleTests`. Observed: `swift test --package-path Packages/RunnerControlCore` exit 0 (224 passed), `python3 -m unittest discover -s Scripts/tests` exit 0 (62 OK), `./Scripts/build.sh` exit 0 with `codesign --verify` exit 0 (1.2.0, works.relux.runnercontrol, 262RZ595FP), 4 narrowing mutants killed exit 1 with retained-gate controls passing and 0 survivors. Production runners untouched (both running, manual login OFF preserved); candidate left uncommitted. Outcome attached as `TASK-260916-304bw2_catalog-lifecycle-r4-outcome.md`.","reason":null}}
